{\an8}♪～ One day この声が届くまで

50
00:02:55,409 --> 00:02:58,345
{\an8}♪～ Where are you？
ただ探している

51
00:02:58,412 --> 00:03:01,348
{\an8}♪～ One more time,
One more time

52
00:03:01,415 --> 00:03:03,784
{\an8}♪～ Where are you？
I wanna step out with you

53
00:03:03,851 --> 00:03:06,854
{\an8}♪～ One more time
in this world

